      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-05-15T17:10:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would say that you cannont \"Sac\" a card under her. She stole it. It is no longer in your possesion to sacrifice. I would be surprised if there was a ruling to the contrary here.</p>",
